class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9fbacb16db1e028f\" href=\"?note=9fbacb16db1e028f\" title=\"62-thm-WKL0-conservative\">62-thm-WKL0-conservative</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Corollaries IX.1.11, IX.2.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>365</span><span>368</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>383</span><span>386</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0f9bb628fd6df6ce\" href=\"?note=0f9bb628fd6df6ce\" title=\"62-df-first-order-arithmetic\">62-df-first-order-arithmetic</a>，Cn 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>；主保守性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9fbacb16db1e028f\" href=\"?note=9fbacb16db1e028f\" title=\"62-thm-WKL0-conservative\">62-thm-WKL0-conservative</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}first\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0)=\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)=\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}first\\text{-}order}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0)=\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)=\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\\cap\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{I}\\Sigma_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IX.1.10–IX.1.11 给 IΣ₁ 的模型以 Δ⁰₁ 可定义集扩充成 RCA₀。IX.2.6 再使 WKL₀ 与 RCA₀ 的一阶后果一致。三个理论并非整体等价：它们的集合存在结论不同。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Corollaries IX.1.11, IX.2.7；纸面页 365, 368；PDF 页 383, 386。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-first-order-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0f9bb628fd6df6ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-first-order-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-WKL0-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"9fbacb16db1e028f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-WKL0-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":